[00:00.00]Today, I want to talk about how to train your brain to speak English every day.|今天我想聊聊，如何训练你的大脑，让说英语变成每天的习惯。
[00:05.76]Many people think English is difficult, but English is not only about grammar.|很多人觉得英语很难，但英语不只是语法。
[00:10.84]English is a habit.|英语是一种习惯。
[00:12.42]If you train your brain daily, speaking English becomes easy and natural.|如果你每天训练大脑，说英语就会变得轻松又自然。
[00:16.86]First, you must listen every day.|第一，你必须每天听。
[00:20.02]Listening is very important.|听非常关键。
[00:21.94]Your brain learns sounds before it speaks.|大脑是先学会声音，之后才学会开口的。
[00:24.76]Listen to simple English podcasts, short videos, or English conversations.|去听简单的英语播客、短视频，或者英语对话。
[00:29.12]Do not worry if you do not understand everything. Just listen. Your brain is learning. Second,|不必担心听不懂全部，听就是了，你的大脑正在学习。第二，
[00:37.58]speak every day. Do not wait until your English is perfect. Speak alone. Yes, speak alone in your|每天开口说。不要等到英语完美才开始。自言自语也行。对，就在你自己的
[00:45.02]room. Talk about your day. For example, today I woke up at 7 a.m. I ate breakfast. I went to work.|房间里说。聊聊你的一天。比如：今天我七点起床，吃了早饭，然后去上班。
[00:51.92]Simple sentences are okay. The goal is practice, not perfection. Third, think in English.|简单句就可以。目标是练习，不是完美。第三，用英语思考。
[00:59.12]This is very powerful.|这一点非常有力。
[01:00.66]When you see a car, say in your mind, that car is very fast.|看到一辆车时，在心里说：那辆车很快。
[01:05.14]When you eat food, think this food tastes good.|吃东西的时候，想着：这个味道不错。
[01:09.12]Change your daily thoughts into English.|把每天的念头换成英语。
[01:11.36]This trains your brain to use English naturally.|这会训练你的大脑自然地使用英语。
[01:14.36]Fourth, learn small words daily.|第四，每天学一点小词。
[01:17.58]Do not try to learn 50 words in one day.|不要想着一天背 50 个单词。
[01:20.86]Learn five words.|学 5 个就好。
[01:22.34]Use them in sentences.|把它们放进句子里用。
[01:24.08]Repeat them many times.|反复重复很多遍。
[01:26.04]Repetition helps your brain remember.|重复能帮大脑记住。
[01:28.52]Fifth, do not be afraid of mistakes.|第五，别怕犯错。
[01:31.32]Mistakes are your teachers.|错误就是你的老师。
[01:33.14]Every mistake helps you grow.|每一个错误都让你进步。
[01:35.08]Even native speakers make mistakes.|就连母语者也会犯错。
[01:37.26]So relax and continue speaking.|所以放轻松，继续说下去。
[01:39.82]Also, practice shadowing.|另外，练一练影子跟读。
[01:42.50]Shadowing means you listen to a sentence and repeat it immediately.|影子跟读就是听到一句话，立刻跟着重复。
[01:46.08]Copy the pronunciation and rhythm.|模仿它的发音和节奏。
[01:48.14]This improves your speaking speed and confidence.|这能提升你的语速和自信。
[01:50.98]Finally, be consistent.|最后，要坚持。
[01:53.52]Practice 10 to 20 minutes every day.|每天练 10 到 20 分钟。
[01:56.24]Small practice every day is better than three hours once a week.|每天练一点点，胜过一周猛练三小时。
[01:59.52]Your brain loves repetition.|你的大脑喜欢重复。
[02:01.96]Remember, learning English is like going to the gym.|记住，学英语就像去健身房。
[02:05.58]If you train your body daily, you become strong.|每天锻炼身体，你就会变强壮。
[02:08.86]If you train your brain daily, your English becomes strong.|每天训练大脑，你的英语就会变强。
[02:12.82]Start today.|从今天开始。
[02:14.02]Speak today.|今天就说。
[02:15.54]Make English part of your life.|让英语成为你生活的一部分。
